-- הסכם קיבוצי — דחיית המועד להקצאת הפעימה האחרונה של עלות הסכם המסגרת
-- (22.7.2013): with the State's finances to be steadied in 2013–2014, the
-- teaching employees in the civil service share the burden for a time. The
-- allocation of the framework agreement's cost due from 1.7.2013 under
-- §155(א) of the base agreement, at the rate §92(ג) of the completion
-- agreement of 29.2.2012 set, is put off to 1.1.2015; pension
-- contributions, budgetary and bridging pensions and the one-off payment on
-- the end of work are computed as if it had not been; the clothing
-- allowance is 1,877 for תשע"ג and 84% of the Accountant General's level 3
-- or level 4 amount for תשע"ד, the same payments again computed as if it had
-- not been cut; from 1.7.2013.
--
-- It puts off what the completion agreement's §92 set, so it imports that
-- agreement (`the 2011 supplement rate under §92`) and the base agreement's
-- §155 (`way of applying a framework cost`). The law of 2013 its recital
-- names, the Accountant General's clothing amounts and the clothing
-- agreement of 19.7.2011 are not encoded here: each is a named input.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `base-agreement-155`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`

-- The end of the period §§5 and 7 compute as if nothing were put off; it
-- opens on the day the agreement starts (§8).
`the period §§5 and 7 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 compute whole ends on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2014

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE d `is in the period §§5 and 7 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 compute whole` IF
        d `is on or after` `the deferral of 22.7.2013 starts on`
    AND d `is on or before` `the period §§5 and 7 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 compute whole ends on`

-- What §§5 and 7 compute as if nothing were put off, and the salary itself,
-- which they leave to §§4 and 6.
-- The provident fund is one the Control of Financial Services (Provident
-- Funds) Law, 2005 defines; the pensions and the one-off payments are paid
-- by law or by agreement; §7(ג) names the public employer's one-off
-- payment, §5(ג) does not.
DECLARE `payment under the deferral of 22.7.2013` IS ONE OF
    `the monthly salary`
    `a contribution to a provident fund for an annuity`
    `budgetary pension`
    `a one-off payment the State makes on the end of work`
    `a one-off payment a public employer makes on the end of work`
    `bridging pension`

§ `דחיית הפעימה האחרונה של עלות הסכם המסגרת — 22.7.2013`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp: registered as a collective agreement on 18.11.2013, number 215/2013; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The date of signing; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The first party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "And between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The second party, the teachers' union, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The second party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the State's fiscal stability was shaken in the last two years; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the State's spending and income for 2013 and 2014 need adjusting; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the employees share the burden for a time, as this agreement sets out; §§4–7 carry it.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: the temporary-provision law of 2013 in force from 1.7.2013, whose §3 puts off raises due under the collective agreement that applies; not encoded here, and §4 carries what this agreement puts off.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: the parties negotiated and agreed; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 המבוא`

-- The preamble and the annexes are part of the agreement.
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the preamble and annexes of the deferral of 22.7.2013 bind as the agreement` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 לשון`

-- A word in the masculine reads in the feminine and the plural too, and
-- the other way, unless said otherwise in so many words.
@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `said otherwise in so many words` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word of the deferral of 22.7.2013 reads in every gender and number` `said otherwise in so many words` IF
    NOT `said otherwise in so many words`

§§ `3 תחולה`

-- Every employee in the civil service ranked on the teaching employees'
-- scale ("עובדי הוראה"), those in supervision and staff roles among them.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN `employed in the civil service` IS A BOOLEAN, `ranked on the teaching employees' scale` IS A BOOLEAN, `in a supervision or staff role` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the deferral of 22.7.2013` `employed in the civil service` `ranked on the teaching employees' scale` `in a supervision or staff role` IF
    `employed in the civil service` AND `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`

#ASSERT `covered by the deferral of 22.7.2013` TRUE TRUE TRUE

§§ `4 דחיית המועד להקצאת הפעימה האחרונה של עלות הסכם המסגרת`

-- The allocation of the cost due from 1.7.2013 under §155(א) of the base
-- agreement, at the rate §92(ג) of the completion agreement set, is put off
-- to 1.1.2015. §92(ג) is the July 2013 allocation, which the completion
-- agreement's encoding reads as the 2011 supplement's rise to 6.35%; put
-- off, the rate of §92(ב), 5.75%, holds from 1.7.2013 to 31.12.2014.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
`the day the allocation of §92(ג) is made, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts it off` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2015

GIVEN `the rate before 1.1.2012` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts off its last part` `the rate before 1.1.2012` d IS
    IF     d `is on or after` `1 July 2013`
       AND NOT d `is on or after` `the day the allocation of §92(ג) is made, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts it off`
    THEN `the 2011 supplement rate under §92` `the rate before 1.1.2012` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2013)
    ELSE `the 2011 supplement rate under §92` `the rate before 1.1.2012` d

-- The clause it is made under, as §4 names it.
`the clause the deferred allocation is made under` MEANS "155(א)"

#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts off its last part` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) EQUALS 5.75%
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts off its last part` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2014) EQUALS 5.75%
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts off its last part` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2015) EQUALS 6.35%
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts off its last part` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2013) EQUALS 5.75%

§§ `5 תשלומים המחושבים כאילו לא נדחתה ההקצאה`

-- For 1.7.2013 to 31.12.2014, (א) a contribution to a provident fund for
-- an annuity, (ב) budgetary pension, (ג) a one-off payment the State makes
-- on the end of work and (ד) bridging pension are computed as if the
-- allocation had been made on time and the cost applied by §155(א)(1) and
-- (2) of the base agreement.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5__para_a akn:art_5__para_b akn:art_5__para_c akn:art_5__para_d
`the payments §5 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes whole` MEANS
    LIST `a contribution to a provident fund for an annuity`, `budgetary pension`, `a one-off payment the State makes on the end of work`, `bridging pension`

`the ways §5 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 takes the cost as applied` MEANS
    LIST `a uniform rise of the reform salary tables`, `a separate supplement line, and the shekel supplements raised by it`

GIVEN pay IS A `payment under the deferral of 22.7.2013`, `the rate before 1.1.2012` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement rate the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes` pay `the rate before 1.1.2012` d IS
    IF     elem pay `the payments §5 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes whole`
       AND d `is in the period §§5 and 7 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 compute whole`
    THEN `the 2011 supplement rate under §92` `the rate before 1.1.2012` d
    ELSE `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts off its last part` `the rate before 1.1.2012` d

#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes` `budgetary pension` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) EQUALS 6.35%
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes` `the monthly salary` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) EQUALS 5.75%
-- The period §5 computes whole ends the day before the allocation is made.
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL `the period §§5 and 7 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 compute whole ends on` PLUS 1 EQUALS DATE_SERIAL `the day the allocation of §92(ג) is made, as the deferral of 22.7.2013 puts it off`
-- The two ways are the two §155(א) gives where the parties did not agree.
#ASSERT elem (`how a framework cost is applied` 90 FALSE TRUE) `the ways §5 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 takes the cost as applied`
#ASSERT elem (`how a framework cost is applied` 90 FALSE FALSE) `the ways §5 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 takes the cost as applied`

§§ `6 קצובת ביגוד`

-- Notwithstanding any collective agreement or other instruction that
-- applies to teaching employees: (א) for תשע"ג the clothing allowance is
-- 1,877 for every teaching employee; (ב) for תשע"ד, 84% of the amount the
-- Accountant General's instructions fix for level 3, to one whose seniority
-- is up to 25 years ("ועד בכלל", so 25 is in), and for level 4, to one whose
-- seniority is above 25. The Accountant General's amounts are an input
-- (amounts.inputs).
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1 akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_b akn:art_6__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_b__subpara_2
ASSUME `the clothing amount the Accountant General fixes for level` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER

`the clothing allowance for 5773 under the deferral of 22.7.2013` MEANS 1877
`the share of the Accountant General's amount for 5774` MEANS 84%

GIVEN `years of seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Accountant General's level for the 5774 clothing allowance` `years of seniority` IS
    IF `years of seniority` `is above` 25 THEN 4 ELSE 3

-- The school year by the calendar year it opens in (convention
-- dates.school-year): תשע"ג in 2012, תשע"ד in 2013. Another year is not
-- this agreement's: NOTHING.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `years of seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing allowance under the deferral of 22.7.2013 for the school year opening in` y `years of seniority` IS
    BRANCH
        IF y EQUALS 2012 THEN JUST `the clothing allowance for 5773 under the deferral of 22.7.2013`
        IF y EQUALS 2013
        THEN JUST (`the share of the Accountant General's amount for 5774`
                   TIMES `the clothing amount the Accountant General fixes for level` (`the Accountant General's level for the 5774 clothing allowance` `years of seniority`))
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

#ASSERT `the Accountant General's level for the 5774 clothing allowance` 25 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the Accountant General's level for the 5774 clothing allowance` 25.5 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the clothing allowance under the deferral of 22.7.2013 for the school year opening in` 2012 30 EQUALS JUST 1877
#ASSERT `the clothing allowance under the deferral of 22.7.2013 for the school year opening in` 2014 30 EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `7 תשלומים המחושבים כאילו לא קוצצה קצובת הביגוד`

-- For 1.7.2013 to 31.12.2014, (א) a contribution to a provident fund for
-- an annuity, (ב) budgetary pension, (ג) a one-off payment the State or a
-- public employer makes on the end of work and (ד) bridging pension are
-- computed as if the clothing allowance had been paid by the collective
-- agreements in force on the eve of this one, that of 19.7.2011 among them
-- (not encoded here; an input).
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7__para_a akn:art_7__para_b akn:art_7__para_c akn:art_7__para_d
ASSUME `the clothing allowance under the agreements in force on 21.7.2013, that of 19.7.2011 among them` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER AND NUMBER TO NUMBER

`the payments §7 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes whole` MEANS
    LIST `a contribution to a provident fund for an annuity`, `budgetary pension`, `a one-off payment the State makes on the end of work`,
         `a one-off payment a public employer makes on the end of work`, `bridging pension`

GIVEN pay IS A `payment under the deferral of 22.7.2013`, d IS A DATE, y IS A NUMBER, `years of seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing allowance the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes` pay d y `years of seniority` IS
    IF     elem pay `the payments §7 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes whole`
       AND d `is in the period §§5 and 7 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 compute whole`
    THEN JUST (`the clothing allowance under the agreements in force on 21.7.2013, that of 19.7.2011 among them` y `years of seniority`)
    ELSE `the clothing allowance under the deferral of 22.7.2013 for the school year opening in` y `years of seniority`

#ASSERT `the clothing allowance the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes` `the monthly salary` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) 2012 10 EQUALS JUST 1877
-- §7 names the public employer's one-off payment; §5 does not.
#ASSERT elem `a one-off payment a public employer makes on the end of work` `the payments §7 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes whole`
#ASSERT NOT elem `a one-off payment a public employer makes on the end of work` `the payments §5 of the deferral of 22.7.2013 computes whole`

§§ `8 תחילה`

-- The agreement starts on 1.7.2013, before its signing.
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8/p1
`the deferral of 22.7.2013 starts on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013

`the signing of the deferral of 22.7.2013` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 22 7 2013
#ASSERT `the signing of the deferral of 22.7.2013` `is on or after` `the deferral of 22.7.2013 starts on`

§§ `9 הסכמים קודמים`

-- Terms the parties set before — in collective agreements, collective
-- arrangements or written undertakings — stay in force for this
-- agreement's term, unless one of its clauses amended or cancelled them,
-- expressly or by implication.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9/p1
GIVEN `amended or cancelled by the deferral of 22.7.2013` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an earlier term stays in force beside the deferral of 22.7.2013` `amended or cancelled by the deferral of 22.7.2013` IF
    NOT `amended or cancelled by the deferral of 22.7.2013`

-- §6 sets the clothing allowance "notwithstanding any collective
-- agreement": the earlier clothing terms are amended for תשע"ג and תשע"ד.
#ASSERT NOT `an earlier term stays in force beside the deferral of 22.7.2013` TRUE

§§ `10 מיצוי תביעות ושקט תעשייתי`

-- Nothing here takes from the provisions on exhaustion of claims and
-- industrial peace that apply between the parties.
@ref akn:art_10
`the deferral of 22.7.2013 leaves the exhaustion and industrial-peace provisions whole` MEANS TRUE

